          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:21a7e7492295a9a859465dbdc5350520a3737c4a03485ff32d3f538dc5eddb87:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3a2805a39677431a8b172df5e560b15a",
      "statement": "Resources are scoped to individual users between collaborators: build collaborators resolve AI models from their own account and add gatekeeper bindings through their own connected accounts (newGatekeeper calls the opening user's getGatekeeperClassFor, not the owner's), so no collaborator implicitly gains access to another user's third-party accounts; only the owner can delete the gadget.",
