    {
      "id": "claim_7289ab4af39544e0a1e2cd61d798efbd",
      "statement": "hasAnyShares() reflects current reachability — a live path from the owner or any un-revoked link — rather than mere table membership, because the lazy model leaves dead records in storage; and an observation that would set prohibitAllSharing is blocked rather than applied when the gadget is already shared, so the flag only flips on an unshared gadget with no other sessions to evict.",
