    {
      "id": "claim_6ce0c608e9364744ae7c0a433eefa27e",
      "statement": "Share-key redemption and gadget opening happen atomically in one RPC (openGadget redeems inside open() so subsequent calls pipeline on the returned stub), and a collaborator's home-page record is written on first open (with cached title and owner profile) plus refreshed on later opens via a fire-and-forget recordSharedGadgetOpen/syncOutputsTo sequence.",
